flowchart TD
    %% Styles for DFD
    classDef process fill:#ffffff,stroke:#000000,stroke-width:2px,color:#000000;
    classDef entity fill:#ffffff,stroke:#000000,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray: 5 5,color:#000000;
    classDef store fill:#ffffff,stroke:#000000,stroke-width:2px,shape:cylinder,color:#000000;

    %% External Entities
    User[User / Donor]:::entity
    Admin[Admin]:::entity
    EmailSystem[Email Service]:::entity

    %% Processes
    P1((1.0 Submit Donation)):::process
    P2((2.Transparency and trust
Verification workflow: Admin review, document checks, and status transitions for institutions and needs before going live.​

Audit logs and reports: Immutable logs of donations, disbursements, and updates with exportable reports.​

Public dashboards: Aggregate metrics, impact counters, and recently funded items to build trust0 Verify Donation)):::process
    P3((3.0 Generate Certificate)):::process
    P4((4.0 View Reports)):::process

    %% Data Stores
    D1[(Donations DB)]:::store
    D2[(Storage Bucket)]:::store

    %% Data Flows
    User -->|Donation Details & Proof| P1
    P1 -->|Save Record| D1
    P1 -->|Upload Image| D2
    
    Admin -->|Fetch Pending| P2
    D1 -->|Donation Data| P2
    P2 -->|Update Status| D1
    
    P2 -->|Trigger| P3
    P3 -->|Fetch Details| D1
    P3 -->|Send Certificate| EmailSystem
    EmailSystem -->|Email| User
    
    Admin -->|Request Stats| P4
    D1 -->|Aggregated Data| P4
    P4 -->|Dashboard View| Admin

    %% Layout adjustments for size/clarity
    linkStyle default stroke:#000000,stroke-width:2px;
